{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cUOYuBe9Jd1792668030.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港高爾夫球公開賽於粉嶺展開，兩位香港球手並列第五，許龍一首回合成績一般。</p><p></p><p>許龍一有四個洞造出低一桿的「小鳥」，但三個洞超標，成績是低1桿的69，與20位球手並列61位。隊友張雄熙及林日曦，則以低6桿並列第五，落後榜首2桿。</p><p></p><p>另一香港球手沈弘毅，以低4桿的66，並列21位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:02.889708+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:47:33.369909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:36.030015+00:00","content_hash":"9c8c0e4a9c4ac10ff8e4d9a99d3f7929807769d85b043d3305f097c424cbd4f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:02.889708+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}